WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.366 --> 00:00:04.500
The Kalos League semifinal match

2
00:00:04.566 --> 00:00:06.533
between Ash and Sawyer is under way.

3
00:00:07.066 --> 00:00:10.366
Will Ash settle an old score and win against his rival?

4
00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:13.866
One of them will face Alain in the finals, but which one?

5
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.766
What's that about? Aegislash chopped every tree on the battlefield.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.666
- Let's see what you're up to, Sawyer.
- Pika.

7
00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:26.633
Why? Why would they chop all the trees?

8
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.433
Knowing Sawyer, he's no doubt got some plan.

9
00:00:29.966 --> 00:00:34.200
Normally, someone would do that so it would be easier to see. But now?

10
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.266
- All right. Good work, Aegislash.
- Aegis.

11
00:00:39.066 --> 00:00:41.566
All right, here they come, Pikachu.

12
00:00:41.633 --> 00:00:42.900
Pika.

13
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:51.266
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

14
00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:55.200
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

15
00:00:55.733 --> 00:00:59.100
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

16
00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:01.833
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

17
00:01:02.433 --> 00:01:03.633
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

18
00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:06.733
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

19
00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.966
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

20
00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:11.700
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

21
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.666
Sawyer's up to something interesting. How marvelous.

22
00:01:27.733 --> 00:01:31.000
So far, he's been planning his tactics very carefully.

23
00:01:31.433 --> 00:01:35.733
We'll find out if he's coming up with something to defeat Pikachu soon.

24
00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.800
- Pikachu, iron tail.
- Pikachu!

25
00:01:41.866 --> 00:01:43.266
King's shield, go!

26
00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:45.900
Gis. Aegis.

27
00:01:46.666 --> 00:01:49.533
Pika! Pi. Pika.

28
00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:53.866
That's right. If we attack them while Aegislash is using king's shield,

29
00:01:53.933 --> 00:01:56.766
- Pikachu's attack power gets weaker.
- Pika.

30
00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:00.066
So, the more we attack, the worse it is for us.

31
00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.566
What should I do?

32
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.266
- Ash is in a tough spot, all right.
- His attack options are so limited.

33
00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:07.533
- What's he gonna do?
- Hmm.

34
00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:09.066
- Chespin, Che.
- Dedenne.

35
00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:10.633
Use sacred sword.

36
00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.866
Dodge it, quick!

37
00:02:18.733 --> 00:02:20.166
Pika! Pi.

38
00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:21.733
No, Pikachu!

39
00:02:23.566 --> 00:02:25.033
- Pika.
- Hold on.

40
00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:29.566
I get the feeling Sawyer's trying to slow Pikachu down as much as possible.

41
00:02:29.633 --> 00:02:33.366
- What do you mean?
- Chopped trees make Pikachu unsteady.

42
00:02:33.433 --> 00:02:38.100
That keeps it from getting a secure foothold, while Aegislash is floating.

43
00:02:38.166 --> 00:02:40.266
So, Sawyer's got the advantage.

44
00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:44.633
- All right, use sacred sword again.
- Aegis.

45
00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:46.933
Dodge it.

46
00:02:51.433 --> 00:02:52.733
Pika!

47
00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:58.333
- No, Pikachu.
- I can't let you move freely, you know.

48
00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.533
All right. Thunderbolt.

49
00:03:02.966 --> 00:03:04.033
King's shield, go!

50
00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:12.433
- Aegis.
- Pikachu!

51
00:03:12.866 --> 00:03:15.433
- Not again.
- Got an idea I think will work.

52
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.666
I know it's a risk, but we gotta give it a shot, okay?

53
00:03:18.733 --> 00:03:21.100
- Pika.
- I believe in you, buddy.

54
00:03:21.166 --> 00:03:22.933
Pika.

55
00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:27.300
Ash is up to something for sure. I know that expression on his face.

56
00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.466
I've seen it plenty of times.

57
00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:34.066
- Okay, Aegislash, heads up.
- Aegis.

58
00:03:34.133 --> 00:03:36.266
Okay, Pikachu, iron tail.

59
00:03:36.333 --> 00:03:39.833
Pikachu! Pika!

60
00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.333
Pikachu knocked the wood up into the air.

61
00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.700
What could that mean?

62
00:03:45.233 --> 00:03:46.300
What will that do?

63
00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:47.800
Use fury cutter.

64
00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.766
Now, use the trees.

65
00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:13.900
I thought that you'd do that. Aegislash, king's shield.

66
00:04:15.566 --> 00:04:18.233
- Now, Pikachu, use that piece of wood.
- Pika!

67
00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:27.033
- Now, thunderbolt!
- Pikachu!

68
00:04:28.366 --> 00:04:29.500
Aegislash!

69
00:04:33.133 --> 00:04:36.266
Aegislash is unable to battle. Pikachu's the winner.

70
00:04:38.133 --> 00:04:41.333
Incredible strategy. Pikachu jammed up that king's shield

71
00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:44.533
with a piece of wood. I've never seen that before.

72
00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:47.266
Yay! Pikachu won!

73
00:04:48.333 --> 00:04:50.133
That was a classic Ash win.

74
00:04:50.566 --> 00:04:52.433
Aegislash, take a good rest.

75
00:04:53.566 --> 00:04:55.833
- Come here, buddy.
- Pika, Pi!

76
00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:56.800
You did it.

77
00:04:57.566 --> 00:05:00.200
Two wins in a row for Ash and Pikachu.

78
00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:01.766
Three of Sawyer's Pokémon

79
00:05:01.833 --> 00:05:05.200
have been defeated, so, it's time to change the battlefield.

80
00:05:05.633 --> 00:05:09.600
I can't believe you ever would have used a tactic like that.

81
00:05:09.666 --> 00:05:11.633
- I wouldn't have.
- Seriously?

82
00:05:12.033 --> 00:05:16.300
Of course not. Without perfect timing, that never would've worked.

83
00:05:16.366 --> 00:05:19.333
- That's 'cause of you. You're the best.
- Pika, Pika.

84
00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.200
Wow, that's what it is.

85
00:05:22.266 --> 00:05:24.900
Total trust between Ash and Pikachu.

86
00:05:25.233 --> 00:05:27.233
That's why Ash is so strong.

87
00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.333
Now, why don't you show more of what you've got?

88
00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.233
Sure.

89
00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:37.033
And now, the battlefield we've prepared for them is Badlands.

90
00:05:37.466 --> 00:05:39.733
Please get your Pokémon ready.

91
00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:41.700
Noivern, I choose you!

92
00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.900
Noivern.

93
00:05:44.966 --> 00:05:48.100
Ash has sent Noivern in as a substitute for Pikachu.

94
00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:50.566
Show them how it's done.

95
00:05:51.333 --> 00:05:53.166
Salamence, let's go.

96
00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:59.766
Sawyer's fourth Pokémon is Salamence.

97
00:05:59.833 --> 00:06:02.566
Both trainers have chosen Dragon types.

98
00:06:03.733 --> 00:06:06.000
Salamence, the Dragon Pokémon.

99
00:06:06.066 --> 00:06:09.166
Dreams of flight caused a shift in its structure.

100
00:06:09.233 --> 00:06:12.133
When it evolved, Salamence finally grew wings.

101
00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:15.233
So, Shelgon evolved into Salamence, huh? Great.

102
00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:18.433
Thanks, Ash. It's a lot stronger now, too.

103
00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:22.233
- Battle begin!
- Noivern, use boomburst.

104
00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.166
Dodge it, quick.

105
00:06:32.633 --> 00:06:34.900
Noivern strikes first with boomburst.

106
00:06:34.966 --> 00:06:36.900
Noivern, use dragon claw.

107
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.000
-Dragon rush, go!

108
00:06:51.633 --> 00:06:53.100
Noivern, you okay?

109
00:06:54.233 --> 00:06:56.866
I can't afford to lose one more time.

110
00:06:56.933 --> 00:06:58.133
Incinerate.

111
00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:02.233
Dodge it!

112
00:07:08.366 --> 00:07:09.533
Dragon tail, go!

113
00:07:14.533 --> 00:07:18.100
Salamence used the flames from incinerate to lure Noivern in.

114
00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:19.833
Noivern.

115
00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.700
Yeah, way to go.

116
00:07:21.766 --> 00:07:22.933
Incinerate.

117
00:07:23.566 --> 00:07:24.400
Dodge it.

118
00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:32.700
Use boomburst.

119
00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.566
Now, acrobatics.

120
00:07:38.633 --> 00:07:42.700
Oh, no. Even in smoke, Noivern can locate Salamence's position.

121
00:07:43.266 --> 00:07:44.633
Salamence, protect.

122
00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:52.466
- All right, dragon rush, let's go!
- Use acrobatics.

123
00:08:09.833 --> 00:08:13.900
Salamence, Noivern, both are unable to battle.

124
00:08:14.533 --> 00:08:15.533
Both are down.

125
00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.200
It's a draw.

126
00:08:19.233 --> 00:08:23.766
- You were awesome. Take a good rest.
- Thanks for a great battle, Salamence.

127
00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:27.500
- All right, Slurpuff, let's go!
- Slurpuff.

128
00:08:27.566 --> 00:08:30.633
Sawyer has chosen Slurpuff as his fifth Pokémon.

129
00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.166
Now for Ash's choice.

130
00:08:32.233 --> 00:08:34.233
Goodra, I choose you!

131
00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.500
What a surprise.

132
00:08:38.566 --> 00:08:41.366
Ash chose Goodra, which has a type disadvantage.

133
00:08:41.799 --> 00:08:45.800
I know you haven't battled in a long time, but you'll be awesome.

134
00:08:47.266 --> 00:08:48.466
So, it's Goodra,

135
00:08:48.533 --> 00:08:51.966
the only one of Ash's Pokémon I've never battled against.

136
00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.033
I've done no research.

137
00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:57.433
- But let's do our best, Slurpuff!
- Slurpuff.

138
00:08:58.433 --> 00:09:00.933
Who's that Pokémon?

139
00:09:05.633 --> 00:09:07.566
It's Salamence.

140
00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:14.433
Use flamethrower.

141
00:09:15.866 --> 00:09:17.300
Ice beam, let's go!

142
00:09:20.233 --> 00:09:23.366
- Dazzling gleam, now.
- Slurpuff!

143
00:09:25.633 --> 00:09:29.266
A dazzling gleam direct hit. What a super-effective attack.

144
00:09:29.333 --> 00:09:30.833
Goodra!

145
00:09:31.266 --> 00:09:33.400
No doubt Goodra's tough, all right.

146
00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.533
All right, how about this?

147
00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:37.033
Use fairy wind.

148
00:09:37.766 --> 00:09:38.866
Use bide.

149
00:09:43.066 --> 00:09:45.133
All right, Slurpuff, cotton guard.

150
00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:52.200
- Break it up, quick!
- Goodra!

151
00:09:54.433 --> 00:09:55.266
Okay.

152
00:09:55.333 --> 00:09:56.466
Use ice beam.

153
00:09:56.533 --> 00:09:58.733
- Goodra.
- Now flamethrower.

154
00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:01.000
Slurpuff!

155
00:10:03.366 --> 00:10:04.733
Now it's our turn.

156
00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:06.966
All right, Slurpuff, fairy wind.

157
00:10:12.133 --> 00:10:13.766
Slurpuff!

158
00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:18.366
Goodra!

159
00:10:20.166 --> 00:10:22.533
Slurpuff's sense of smell is incredible.

160
00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.266
Even in the smoke, it knows where Goodra is.

161
00:10:26.666 --> 00:10:29.533
Then I guess you're getting me back for Noivern.

162
00:10:31.933 --> 00:10:32.966
Flamethrower.

163
00:10:34.166 --> 00:10:35.000
Use bide.

164
00:10:38.766 --> 00:10:40.833
Goodra, hang in there.

165
00:10:41.233 --> 00:10:44.833
They're feeling it. There's no doubt Goodra's taking damage.

166
00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:47.200
Let's finish this with flamethrower.

167
00:10:47.266 --> 00:10:49.733
Slurpuff.

168
00:10:50.166 --> 00:10:52.566
Oh, no. Hope Goodra can hang in there.

169
00:10:52.633 --> 00:10:53.733
We'll have to see.

170
00:10:54.233 --> 00:10:57.000
Something's gotta give. This can't go on.

171
00:10:58.366 --> 00:11:00.600
- Hmm. Huh?
- Slurpuff?

172
00:11:02.266 --> 00:11:06.000
And Goodra has managed to deal with those fierce flames.

173
00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:10.066
- Go!
- Goodra!

174
00:11:10.133 --> 00:11:13.200
- Slurpuff, fairy wind.
- Slurpuff!

175
00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.166
Huh?

176
00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:23.266
Both are unable to battle.

177
00:11:25.033 --> 00:11:27.233
And it's another double defeat.

178
00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:29.066
What a clash of wills.

179
00:11:29.133 --> 00:11:32.166
This match isn't over until it's truly over.

180
00:11:32.933 --> 00:11:37.800
- This is a battle I'll never forget.
- I feel like I can barely catch my breath.

181
00:11:37.866 --> 00:11:40.100
Thank you, Slurpuff. You were great.

182
00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:44.600
You were awesome, Goodra. You deserve a good rest.

183
00:11:44.666 --> 00:11:47.266
Now we wait for Sawyer's sixth Pokémon.

184
00:11:47.966 --> 00:11:49.133
Hmm.

185
00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.100
Sceptile, let's go.

186
00:11:53.966 --> 00:11:57.533
Sceptile!

187
00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.800
Sawyer's using Sceptile.

188
00:11:59.866 --> 00:12:01.866
His final Pokémon.

189
00:12:01.933 --> 00:12:05.566
Pikachu's already taken damage, but Greninja hasn't gone yet.

190
00:12:05.633 --> 00:12:08.633
And don't forget, Sceptile can mega-evolve.

191
00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.633
Oh, Ash, take care.

192
00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.400
Pikachu, you're up.

193
00:12:12.466 --> 00:12:14.800
Pi. Pika.

194
00:12:14.866 --> 00:12:17.500
There it is. Ash has chosen Pikachu.

195
00:12:17.966 --> 00:12:22.033
All right, Pikachu, quick attack.

196
00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:23.866
Keep your distance, Sceptile.

197
00:12:24.233 --> 00:12:25.866
Use leaf storm.

198
00:12:25.933 --> 00:12:28.300
Sceptile!

199
00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.733
Thunderbolt.

200
00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:34.300
Pikachu!

201
00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:37.933
A power move.

202
00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.200
Iron tail, go!

203
00:12:41.533 --> 00:12:42.666
Use leaf blade.

204
00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.200
Use frenzy plant.

205
00:12:54.933 --> 00:12:55.900
Dodge it.

206
00:13:00.533 --> 00:13:01.533
Pikachu!

207
00:13:02.533 --> 00:13:05.700
Pikachu is unable to battle. Sceptile's the winner.

208
00:13:07.533 --> 00:13:10.466
- Oh, no. Poor Pikachu.
- I think Pikachu

209
00:13:10.533 --> 00:13:13.300
had already taken too much damage from before.

210
00:13:14.866 --> 00:13:16.533
Pikachu, you were great.

211
00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:17.766
Take a good rest.

212
00:13:18.866 --> 00:13:21.766
Now Ash is down to his last Pokémon.

213
00:13:21.833 --> 00:13:24.466
This battle has reached its final chapter.

214
00:13:24.866 --> 00:13:26.500
All right, let's do it.

215
00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.166
Greninja, I choose you!

216
00:13:30.266 --> 00:13:31.700
Greninja.

217
00:13:31.766 --> 00:13:35.333
I've been waiting for Greninja. It's finally come to this.

218
00:13:35.833 --> 00:13:39.266
Hey, sorry we made you wait. This one will decide it all.

219
00:13:39.333 --> 00:13:42.366
- Let's give it everything we've got.
- Right with you, Ash.

220
00:13:42.433 --> 00:13:44.466
We'll leave it all on the field.

221
00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:46.666
Greninja, water shuriken.

222
00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:49.966
Greninja!

223
00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:51.533
Use dragon claw.

224
00:13:58.566 --> 00:14:00.200
Double team, let's go.

225
00:14:01.966 --> 00:14:03.766
Use frenzy plant.

226
00:14:03.833 --> 00:14:06.600
Sceptile!

227
00:14:13.866 --> 00:14:15.566
There. Use leaf blade.

228
00:14:17.833 --> 00:14:19.066
Use cut.

229
00:14:26.366 --> 00:14:28.666
I can hardly catch my breath watching.

230
00:14:28.733 --> 00:14:30.933
Seems like the arena feels the same.

231
00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.100
Incredible.

232
00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:33.933
Hmm.

233
00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:38.433
Ash... I've been trying to catch up to you this whole time.

234
00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:43.133
At first, it seemed so impossible, so insurmountable...

235
00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:48.666
but if I can beat you today, I think I can truly reach the next level.

236
00:14:49.666 --> 00:14:52.233
That's why I wanted to battle the real Ash.

237
00:14:52.533 --> 00:14:54.933
And he came back just like he promised.

238
00:14:55.833 --> 00:14:59.033
Looks like our unfinished battle will end right here.

239
00:15:00.066 --> 00:15:02.000
Sawyer, I'm sorry.

240
00:15:02.266 --> 00:15:03.233
I panicked.

241
00:15:03.533 --> 00:15:04.633
I was scared.

242
00:15:05.533 --> 00:15:08.866
Scared of you because you were coming up on me so fast.

243
00:15:08.933 --> 00:15:11.200
And then, suddenly, you surpassed me.

244
00:15:11.633 --> 00:15:15.366
But thanks to you, I was able to rediscover myself.

245
00:15:15.433 --> 00:15:18.066
I'll show you what we're really made of.

246
00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.633
Here goes, Greninja.

247
00:15:21.833 --> 00:15:23.300
Full power!

248
00:15:24.733 --> 00:15:27.800
Greninja!

249
00:15:36.233 --> 00:15:39.300
There it is, that mysterious Greninja.

250
00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.000
Yay! Go Ash-Greninja!

251
00:15:44.766 --> 00:15:46.166
We're ready, Sceptile.

252
00:15:46.666 --> 00:15:48.533
We've got tons of experience.

253
00:15:51.033 --> 00:15:52.233
Sceptile.

254
00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.033
Mega-evolve.

255
00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:58.566
Sceptile!

256
00:15:59.566 --> 00:16:05.500
Sceptile!

257
00:16:05.566 --> 00:16:08.333
Sceptile has evolved into Mega Sceptile!

258
00:16:09.166 --> 00:16:10.733
Frenzy plant, go!

259
00:16:11.233 --> 00:16:13.533
Sceptile!

260
00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.500
Dodge it!

261
00:16:19.333 --> 00:16:20.533
Use cut!

262
00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:25.566
Now, water shuriken.

263
00:16:28.233 --> 00:16:29.233
Dragon claw.

264
00:16:31.233 --> 00:16:32.833
Now, aerial ace.

265
00:16:39.466 --> 00:16:41.000
Leaf storm, let's go!

266
00:16:46.666 --> 00:16:50.033
- Use leaf blade.
- Sceptile!

267
00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:51.066
Cut, let's go!

268
00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:02.633
Quick, use leaf storm.

269
00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.533
- Not yet!
- Wrap this up.

270
00:17:11.599 --> 00:17:12.866
Frenzy plant!

271
00:17:19.133 --> 00:17:20.033
Use cut!

272
00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:29.666
Ash-Greninja keeps getting pushed back. It can't close the gap

273
00:17:29.733 --> 00:17:33.500
- between the two of them.
- How do you handle the frenzy plant?

274
00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.033
Yeah.

275
00:17:36.166 --> 00:17:38.900
What now? Is Ash gonna lose?

276
00:17:38.966 --> 00:17:42.233
Don't worry. Ash is one with Greninja right now

277
00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:45.266
and they won't give up until they've given it all they've got.

278
00:17:45.333 --> 00:17:48.433
Ash's power is the power of two becoming one.

279
00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.166
As long as Ash becomes one with Greninja,

280
00:17:51.233 --> 00:17:56.066
and as long as Greninja becomes one with Ash, they'll be stronger for it.

281
00:17:56.133 --> 00:17:57.033
Use cut.

282
00:17:58.400 --> 00:17:59.900
Ninja!

283
00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:02.533
Marvelous. Ash has truly become one

284
00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.333
- with his Greninja.
- Yes.

285
00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:06.900
Go!

286
00:18:08.533 --> 00:18:10.800
Now, Greninja, double team. Let's go!

287
00:18:13.633 --> 00:18:15.566
Get ready for this, Sawyer.

288
00:18:15.633 --> 00:18:19.233
This is everything Greninja and I have got. Water shuriken.

289
00:18:19.666 --> 00:18:22.333
Greninja!

290
00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.833
Sceptile, use leaf storm.

291
00:18:44.333 --> 00:18:46.233
Sceptile is unable to battle.

292
00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:47.200
Greninja wins.

293
00:18:47.266 --> 00:18:48.866
The match goes to Ash.

294
00:18:51.666 --> 00:18:53.433
That's that. It's decided.

295
00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:56.100
Ash will be moving on to the finals.

296
00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.366
Ash did it!

297
00:18:59.433 --> 00:19:01.433
All right! Ash won!

298
00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:02.900
Way to go, Ash.

299
00:19:02.966 --> 00:19:04.900
Congratulations, Ash.

300
00:19:04.966 --> 00:19:07.133
- Ash is awesome.
- What a win.

301
00:19:07.566 --> 00:19:11.566
- Everybody was so great in that battle.
- Mm-hm, mm-hm.

302
00:19:11.633 --> 00:19:12.900
Incredible.

303
00:19:12.966 --> 00:19:14.700
That was a Pokémon battle.

304
00:19:15.133 --> 00:19:20.200
Let's give another big round of applause for this stupendous battle.

305
00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.366
We really did it, Greninja.

306
00:19:28.266 --> 00:19:30.400
Wow, the twerp pulled it off.

307
00:19:30.466 --> 00:19:34.066
- We know what that means.
- He could win the whole enchilada.

308
00:19:34.133 --> 00:19:35.366
Incredible.

309
00:19:35.433 --> 00:19:38.300
That was truly an indescribable match.

310
00:19:38.366 --> 00:19:40.733
The future is bright for those two trainers.

311
00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.366
It'd make me very happy

312
00:19:42.433 --> 00:19:45.500
if there were more trainers like them in the world.

313
00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.166
Yeah. I agree completely.

314
00:19:57.466 --> 00:20:00.000
I experienced everything you had to give.

315
00:20:00.366 --> 00:20:03.766
It reminded me once again why I admire you so much.

316
00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:07.300
It was great for sure. You had me so super psyched.

317
00:20:07.366 --> 00:20:10.566
- I was having a ball.
- And thanks for the kind words.

318
00:20:10.633 --> 00:20:13.900
I'm gonna keep training, battling and gaining experience.

319
00:20:13.966 --> 00:20:17.233
And one day I'm gonna be even better than you.

320
00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:19.900
And don't you forget, I'm gonna work harder

321
00:20:19.966 --> 00:20:24.233
and get stronger, too. I'll never give up. We'll battle again, right?

322
00:20:24.666 --> 00:20:25.500
Battle again?

323
00:20:26.033 --> 00:20:26.866
Right.

324
00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:31.100
The fierce and competitive match

325
00:20:31.166 --> 00:20:33.633
between Ash and Sawyer has come to an end.

326
00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:37.466
Of course, both will continue to gain experience and strength

327
00:20:37.533 --> 00:20:39.933
along with the promise to battle again.

328
00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:44.333
But for now, the finals are up next with Alain as our hero's opponent

329
00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.400
as the journey continues.
